<title>USA: Warner-Lambert Co Q1 shr decreases.</title>
<headline>Warner-Lambert Co Q1 shr decreases.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS PLAINS, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q1 was $0.76 per share.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.75		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net			204,100		  249,500</p>
<p> Sales		  1,777,400		1,829,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 271,310		  271,178</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 operating share was $0.75 in 1997 versus $0.79 in 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 results exclude an after-tax gain of $46 million, or $0.17 per share, on the sale of its Warner Cilcott generic pharmaceutical business, and an after-tax provision of $9 million, or $0.04 per share, for certain legal matters.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
